# HealthSync Web Frontend Environment Variables

# Backend API Endpoint
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:4000

# ==============================================================================
# Google Maps Platform Integration
# ==============================================================================
# To enable live interactive Google Maps, geocoding, and Google Places in the
# Find Hospitals discovery page, provide a Google Maps Platform API key below.
#
# PREREQUISITES:
# 1. A Google Cloud Platform (GCP) project with active billing enabled.
# 2. Enable the following 3 Google Cloud APIs in your GCP Console:
#    - Maps JavaScript API (for interactive map canvas & markers)
#    - Places API / Places API New (for live hospital and clinic discovery queries)
#    - Geocoding API (for address, city, and postal code coordinate resolution)
# 3. Restrict your API key using HTTP referrers:
#    - http://localhost:3000/*
#    - https://your-production-domain.com/*
#
# NOTE: If this key is omitted or left as a placeholder, HealthSync automatically
# renders a graceful, professional fallback banner explaining the setup, while
# preserving 100% functionality of facility searches, filters, and appointment booking.
# ==============================================================================
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=YOUR_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY
